OL,3,GNEWSAThick fog disrupts travel with
OL,4,Afurther weather warning issued
OL,5,
OL,6,FDense fog disrupted travel for many on
OL,7,FMonday morning and is likely to cause
OL,8,Ffurther disruption on Tuesday.
OL,10,FA Met Office warning for much of
OL,11,FEngland and eastern Wales expired at
OL,12,F11:00 GMT on Monday. An additional fog
OL,13,Fwarning for Northern Ireland ended at
OL,14,F10:00 GMT.
OL,16,FAn area of England and Wales stretching
OL,17,Ffrom Canterbury to Cardiff, Hull to St
OL,18,FAsaph and Southampton to York, and
OL,19,Fincluding London, Birmingham and parts
OL,20,Fof Greater Manchester was impacted.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
